# 8. Check Headless Service Endpoints

Run:

```bash
kubectl get endpoints nginx-headless
```

You can also inspect EndpointSlices:

```bash
kubectl get endpointslices -l kubernetes.io/service-name=nginx-headless
```

The endpoint information identifies the backend Pods associated with the Service.

For example:

```text
10.244.0.5:80
10.244.0.6:80
10.244.0.7:80
```

These are example Pod IP addresses.

